  font-family:"Arial",sans-serif'>      (2)  second reinspection, which shall
  occur no sooner than fourteen days following the first reinspection</span></p>
  </td>
  <td width=114 valign=top style='width:85.5pt;padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal align=right style='text-align:right'><span
